{"id": "UgyqHWL5dW1yEbdLmKB4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 3, "text": "감사합니다~❤", "published": "2026-10-17T12:06:11", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgzdCP94SD_9GTu3xct4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "난원래 부터 저러는데\n살거있으면 다이소\n통장은네개만되나더 넘지그래도. 만날 못살아 만날", "published": "2026-10-19T19:18:26", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
